<script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/interface/NewsvoteDWR.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/engine.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/news/newscontent.js"></script><LINK href="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/photoswipe.css" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/pw.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/ajax.js"></script><form name="_newscontent_fromname">
<div style="min-height:300px;">
    <h1 align="center">丁香书院举办“新生杯”单人跳绳赛</h1>
    <div align="center" style="line-height:60px;color:#aaa;">时间：2023-11-29&nbsp;&nbsp;阅读次数：<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1370093333, 11338)</script>&nbsp;</div>
    <div id="vsb_content" style="line-height:24px;"><div class="v_news_content">
<style><!--  /* Font Definitions */  @font-face {font-family:宋体; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"Cambria Math"; panose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:Calibri; panose-1:2 15 5 2 2 2 4 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:微软雅黑; panose-1:2 11 5 3 2 2 4 2 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:"\@微软雅黑"; panose-1:2 11 5 3 2 2 4 2 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:"\@宋体"; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;}  /* Style Definitions */  p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} a:link, span.MsoHyperlink {color:blue; text-decoration:underline;} a:visited, span.MsoHyperlinkFollowed {color:#7E1FAD; text-decoration:underline;} p {margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} p.MsoAcetate, li.MsoAcetate, div.MsoAcetate {mso-style-link:"批注框文本 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} p.a, li.a, div.a {mso-style-name:""; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:center; border:none; padding:0cm; font-size:8.0pt; font-family:"Arial","sans-serif"; display:none;} p.a0, li.a0, div.a0 {mso-style-name:""; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:center; border:none; padding:0cm; font-size:8.0pt; font-family:"Arial","sans-serif"; display:none;} span.Char {mso-style-name:"批注框文本 Char"; mso-style-link:批注框文本; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} .MsoChpDefault {font-size:10.0pt;} @page Section1 {size:595.3pt 841.9pt; margin:72.0pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 90.0pt; vsb_temp:15.6pt;} div.Section1 {page:Section1;} --></style>
<div class="Section1" style="vsb_temp: 15.6pt;">
 <p style="background: white; text-align: left; line-height: 2em;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 9.5pt;">&nbsp;<span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">为提高新生身体素质，加强综合素质发展，丰富校园文化生活，11月17日，丁香书院于南操场举办“新生杯”单人跳绳赛，旨在展现学生风采和运动实力。本次选拔赛面向丁香书院全体学生开展报名，最终共有80余名同学报名参加。</span></span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: 2em;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;"><img width="620" height="327" id="图片 1" alt="IMG_256" src="/__local/B/01/05/0F27051088DCADA232C2AAEE18E_BB91D3AF_1EEA8.gif" border="0" vwidth="620" vheight="327" vurl="/_vsl/B01050F27051088DCADA232C2AAEE18E/BB91D3AF/1EEA8" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/B/01/05/0F27051088DCADA232C2AAEE18E_BB91D3AF_1EEA8.gif" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; line-height: 2em; text-indent: 21pt;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">&nbsp;此次赛事共包括三个项目，分别为一摇跳绳、二摇跳绳和挽花跳绳，每个项目限时1分钟，根据记录成功跳跃次数进行成绩排名，分别决出男生组各项目冠亚军以及女生组各项目冠亚军。这些优秀选手将成为丁香书院代表队的一员，出战“书院杯”体育嘉年华跳绳联赛。</span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: 2em;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;"><img width="620" height="375" id="图片 2" alt="IMG_257" src="/__local/1/25/A6/055B68394F8A7ED6E9DF488B1A7_62B05558_A62D.jpg" border="0" vwidth="620" vheight="375" vurl="/_vsl/125A6055B68394F8A7ED6E9DF488B1A7/62B05558/A62D" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/1/25/A6/055B68394F8A7ED6E9DF488B1A7_62B05558_A62D.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; line-height: 2em; text-indent: 21pt;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">&nbsp;11月17日下午13：00，比赛在书院体育部同学的组织下有序进行。经过了充分的热身后，运动员们精神饱满、跃跃欲试。随着一声哨响，一摇跳绳的比赛正式开始。摇绳的同学凝神静气，有节奏地挥动着双臂，手中的跳绳在空中舞出一条优美的弧线，场上一个接一个矫健的身姿穿梭在舞动的长绳中，同学们神情专注，动作敏捷，展现出青春的律动和风采。每组同学互相监督，跳绳的同学节奏稳定，一旁计数同学各有分工。在短暂休息后，继续进行二摇跳绳以及挽花跳绳选拔，最终比赛顺利结束。</span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: 2em;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;"><img width="300" height="326" id="图片 3" alt="IMG_258" src="/__local/9/A8/D0/64F1EE5F8B0454950C4D00B55FC_9203EFCD_540B.jpg" border="0" vwidth="300" vheight="326" vurl="/_vsl/9A8D064F1EE5F8B0454950C4D00B55FC/9203EFCD/540B" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/9/A8/D0/64F1EE5F8B0454950C4D00B55FC_9203EFCD_540B.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: 2em;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;"><img width="300" height="449" id="图片 4" alt="IMG_259" src="/__local/7/10/5F/4D74BEB374E09CE03D7DF0D72E1_3DFD9817_DBF1.gif" border="0" vwidth="300" vheight="449" vurl="/_vsl/7105F4D74BEB374E09CE03D7DF0D72E1/3DFD9817/DBF1" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/7/10/5F/4D74BEB374E09CE03D7DF0D72E1_3DFD9817_DBF1.gif" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p style="margin: 6pt 0cm; line-height: 2em; text-indent: 21pt;"><span style="background: white; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px;">&nbsp;此次“新生杯”单人跳绳赛展示了新生的蓬勃朝气，提升了同学们的集体荣誉感与责任感。据悉，丁香书院为保障参赛同学的运动安全，提前准备教学视频并采购运动器材，同时充分做好比赛筹备工作，细致安排比赛事宜。后续书院还将继续坚持“体育育人”的办赛理念，开展更多精彩赛事，积极营造书院体育氛围，引导学生在体育锻炼中享受乐趣、增强体质、健全人格、锤炼意志，实现全面发展。</span></p>
</div>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
